  "[action] goes to see father",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"I should have been made an officer long ago and not my brother. He is still only a son and yet he is already an officer.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung listens to his eldest son's complaints.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"I will not ask you, father, to send me, but I will go and see for myself and I will come and go with a large retinue and with my wife and with my children.\"",
